OL,3,ADeath prompts call for allergy
OL,4,Amanagement ratings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 12-year-old girl who
OL,7,Fdied after drinking a milkshake made in
OL,8,Fan unwashed blender at a cafe have
OL,9,Fcalled for a dedicated rating that
OL,10,Fscores food businesses on their allergy
OL,11,Fmanagement.
OL,13,FMia St Hilaire, who had a tree nut
OL,14,Fallergy, suffered an anaphylactic shock
OL,15,Fand died after she drank a Twix
OL,16,Fmilkshake at the Pop Inn Cafe in
OL,17,FBermondsey, south-east London, in
OL,18,FAugust 2023.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
