OL,3,ADeath prompts call for allergy
OL,4,Amanagement ratings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer order contained hazelnut residue
OL,7,Fbecause the blender had not been washed
OL,8,Fafter a Kinder Bueno milkshake was made
OL,9,Fin it beforehand, an inquest concluded
OL,10,Fon Thursday.
OL,12,FIn a statement, her family said
OL,13,F"significant changes" were needed to
OL,14,Fprotect people with food allergies.
